<title>JAPAN: Toyoda Automatic to buy back up to Y10 bln shares.</title>
<headline>Toyoda Automatic to buy back up to Y10 bln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyoda Automatic Loom Works Ltd, a maker of industrial vehicles, said on Wednesday that it plans to buy back up to 10 billion yen worth of its own shares.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement that further details of the buy-back plan would be determined at the next board meeting. It also needs approval from a shareholder meeting to be held in late June.</p>
</text>
